the target language is: lps.

the maximum time is 6.

the events are:
    *a thing* sees.
    gets tired.

the actions are:
    move forward.
    turn right.
    stop.

the fluents are:
    tired.
    the ahead is *a thing*; known as ahead.

the knowledge base louse includes:

initially the ahead is clear.

when a thing sees
then the ahead that is a second thing becomes the thing.

when gets tired
then tired.

if the ahead is clear
    and it is not the case that tired
then move forward.

if the ahead is obstacle
then turn right.

if tired
then stop.

it must not be true that
    move forward from a time to a second time
    and stop from the time to the second time.


scenario one is:
    clear sees from 1 to 2.
    obstacle sees from 2 to 3.
    clear sees from 3 to 4.
    gets tired from 3 to 4.
